  "summary": "多级节点逐层展开：点箭头展开子节点、箭头转向，同级缩进对齐，叶子节点没有箭头。",
  "usage": "文件树、目录树、菜单管理、组织结构：层级 2–4 层、可折叠的导航。",
  "caution": "层级超过 4 层要加横向滚动或面包屑；节点特别多要虚拟滚动；叶子节点不要显示箭头（会误导成可展开）；需要多选时再单独加勾选框。",
  "hint": "点箭头展开/收起子节点",
  "prompt": "【树形展开】目标：多级节点树，点箭头展开子节点（chevron 从右转向下），再点收起；展开的节点文字用品牌色，叶子节点不显示箭头。\n\n1) 结构：`.node` = `.row`（箭头按钮 + 文字）+ `.children`（子节点容器），子节点再嵌套 `.node`。\n\n2) 箭头用 **SVG chevron**：`viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\"`、`path d=\"M4.6 3 L7.4 6 L4.6 9\"`、stroke 1.8、round、11px；展开时 `rotate(90deg)`；颜色 var(--ui-text-dim)，hover 提亮。不要用字符 ▸（小字号下笔画糊）。\n\n3) 只保留箭头 + 文字，不要照搬参考图的方框（那是勾选框语义）。\n\n4) 缩进：`.children{padding-left:16px}`；展开动画 `max-height:0 → 400px`。\n\n5) 叶子节点箭头 `visibility:hidden` 保留占位（删掉会破坏缩进）。\n\n6) **演示脚本取节点要用顶层选择器**：`tree.children` 过滤 `.node`，不要用 `querySelectorAll('.node')`——后者会按文档顺序返回**所有层级**的节点，`[1]` 往往是某个叶子的 `node`，结果演示点在一个不可展开的节点上，看起来什么都没发生（这个坑实际踩过）。\n\n7) 状态：展开节点文字 var(--ui-brand) + 600 字重。\n\n8) 无障碍：`.tw` 加 aria-expanded；children role=\"group\"；树 role=\"tree\"、节点 role=\"treeitem\"；叶子不加 aria-expanded。\n\n9) 自动演示：只在 !window.__uiInteractive 时循环（docs 展开、src 收起 → 点 src 展开 → 停 1.2 秒 → 收起）。\n\n10) 使用场景：文件树/目录树/菜单管理；层级超过 4 层加滚动；叶子不显示箭头。写进 usage / caution。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{margin:0;min-height:100vh;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:20px}\n\n.tree{width:100%;max-width:340px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--ui-surface);border:1px solid var(--ui-border);padding:8px}\n\n.node{min-width:0}\n.row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:5px 6px;border-radius:7px;min-width:0;\n  transition:background .15s ease}\n.row:hover{background:var(--ui-surface-2)}\n\n/* 箭头用 SVG chevron（字符三角太细，小尺寸下糊成一团） */\n.tw{width:20px;height:20px;flex:0 0 auto;border:0;background:transparent;color:var(--ui-text-dim);\n  cursor:pointer;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:0;\n  border-radius:4px;transition:transform .22s ease,color .15s ease,background .15s ease}\n.tw svg{width:11px;height:11px;display:block}\n.tw:hover{color:var(--ui-text);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 7%,transparent)}\n.node.open > .row .tw{transform:rotate(90deg)}\n/* 叶子节点：箭头隐藏但保留占位，缩进才不会乱 */\n.tw.leaf{visibility:hidden;pointer-events:none}\n\n.row span{font-size:11px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;\n  min-width:0;transition:color .18s ease,font-weight .18s ease}\n.node.open > .row span{color:var(--ui-brand);font-weight:600}\n\n.children{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;padding-left:16px;\n  transition:max-height .28s ease}\n.node.open > .children{max-height:400px}\n\n@media (max-height:420px){\n  body{padding:12px}\n  .tree{max-width:320px;padding:6px;border-radius:10px}\n  .row{padding:4px 5px;gap:5px}\n  .tw{width:18px;height:18px}\n  .tw svg{width:10px;height:10px}\n  .row span{font-size:10px}\n  .children{padding-left:14px}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  .tw,.children,.row span{transition:none}\n}\n</style></head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"tree\" id=\"tree\" role=\"tree\">\n  <div class=\"node open\" role=\"treeitem\" aria-expanded=\"true\">\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <button class=\"tw\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-label=\"展开或收起 docs\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <path d=\"M4.6 3 L7.4 6 L4.6 9\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </button>\n      <span>docs</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"children\" role=\"group\">\n      <div class=\"node\" role=\"treeitem\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <button class=\"tw leaf\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\">\n              <path d=\"M4.6 3 L7.4 6 L4.6 9\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </button>\n          <span>README.md</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"node\" role=\"treeitem\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <button class=\"tw leaf\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\">\n              <path d=\"M4.6 3 L7.4 6 L4.6 9\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </button>\n          <span>CHANGELOG.md</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"node\" role=\"treeitem\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <button class=\"tw\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"展开或收起 src\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <path d=\"M4.6 3 L7.4 6 L4.6 9\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </button>\n      <span>src</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"children\" role=\"group\">\n      <div class=\"node\" role=\"treeitem\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <button class=\"tw leaf\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\">\n              <path d=\"M4.6 3 L7.4 6 L4.6 9\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </button>\n          <span>components</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"node\" role=\"treeitem\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n          <button class=\"tw leaf\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\">\n              <path d=\"M4.6 3 L7.4 6 L4.6 9\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </button>\n          <span>utils</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"node\" role=\"treeitem\">\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <button class=\"tw leaf\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\">\n          <path d=\"M4.6 3 L7.4 6 L4.6 9\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </button>\n      <span>package.json</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var tree = document.getElementById('tree');\n  var timer = null, cursor = null;\n\n  function setNode(node, on){\n    node.classList.toggle('open', on);\n    var tw = node.querySelector(':scope > .row > .tw');\n    if(tw && !tw.classList.contains('leaf')){\n      tw.setAttribute('aria-expanded', on ? 'true' : 'false');\n      node.setAttribute('aria-expanded', on ? 'true' : 'false');\n    }\n  }\n\n  var toggles = [].slice.call(tree.querySelectorAll('.tw:not(.leaf)'));\n  toggles.forEach(function(tw){\n    tw.addEventListener('click', function(e){\n      e.stopPropagation();\n      var node = tw.parentNode.parentNode;\n      setNode(node, !node.classList.contains('open'));\n    });\n  });\n\n  function ensureCursor(){\n    if(cursor) return cursor;\n    if(!window.__uiInteractive && typeof window.__uiDemoCursor === 'function'){\n      cursor = window.__uiDemoCursor();\n    }\n    return cursor;\n  }\n\n  function demo(){\n    /* 只取顶层节点：querySelectorAll('.node') 会把嵌套的叶子也算进来，[1] 不是 src */\n    var roots = [].slice.call(tree.children).filter(function(el){\n      return el.classList.contains('node');\n    });\n    var docs = roots[0], src = roots[1];\n    if(!docs || !src) return;\n\n    setNode(docs, true);\n    setNode(src, false);\n\n    var c = ensureCursor();\n    if(!c || !c.el) return;\n\n    var target = src.querySelector(':scope > .row > .tw');\n    if(!target) return;\n\n    c.el.classList.add('show');\n    c.moveTo(target);\n\n    setTimeout(function(){\n      c.press();\n      setTimeout(function(){\n        c.release();\n        setNode(src, true);\n        setTimeout(function(){\n          c.press();\n          setTimeout(function(){\n            c.release();\n            setNode(src, false);\n            if(c.hide) c.hide();\n          }, 190);\n        }, 1200);\n      }, 170);\n    }, 560);\n  }\n\n  function start(){\n    stop();\n    setTimeout(function(){ demo(); timer = setInterval(demo, 4200); }, 400);\n  }\n  function stop(){ if(timer){ clearInterval(timer); timer = null; } }\n\n  if(!window.__uiInteractive) start();\n})();\n</script>\n</body></html>",
